<div xmlns:perseus="http://www.perseus.org/meta/perseus.rdfs#" xmlns:dctype="http://purl.org/dc/dcmitype/" xmlns:tufts="http://www.tufts.edu/" xmlns:alph="http://alpheios.net/namespaces/tei" class="alpheios-lex-text_container en">
    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n91363" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">Πύθια</span></b>  (sc. <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἱερά</span>), τά, <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>the Pythian games</i>, celebrated at Delphi in
			honour of Pythian Apollo, 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἐν Πυθίοισι νικᾶν</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Pi.
					<u>N.</u>
					2.9
				</span></i>
			; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">Π. ἀνελόμενος</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Hdt.
					6.122
				</span></i>
			; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἐνίκα τὰ Π. τῷ τεθρίππῳ</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					D.
					59.33
				</span></i>
			: also of festivals elsewhere, <i><span class="en">
				<u>IG</u>
				3.129
			</span></i>, etc.</div>
